NAME: nicolae_trove_entry_path_of_doom
DEPTH: D:10-, Depths, Elf, Vaults
TAGS: transparent uniq_trove no_monster_gen chance_trove
CHANCE: 5%
KMONS: O = patrolling guardian mummy
KMONS: m = patrolling guardian mummy / nothing w:20
